{
  "slug": "scalekit-agent-auth",
  "name": "Scalekit Agent Auth",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect AI agents to Gmail, Slack, Jira, GitHub & 20+ apps on behalf of users with delegated OAuth, a token vault, and automatic token refresh.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `agent-auth` (Integrates Scalekit Agent Auth into a project to handle OAuth flows, token storage, and automatic refresh for third-party…), `building-agent-mcp-server` (Guides developers through creating a Scalekit MCP server with authenticated tool access), `production-readiness-scalekit` (Walks through a structured production readiness checklist for Scalekit agent authentication implementations)\n- **Agents** (1): `setup-scalekit` (Sets up Scalekit env vars, installs/initializes the SDK, and verifies credentials by listing organizations)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `scalekit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install scalekit-agent-auth@claude-community` from `scalekit-inc/claude-code-authstack` (`plugins/agent-auth`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
